"bn": "তাহলে আমার বিরুদ্ধে চক্রান্ত কর তোমরা", "fa": "پس برای من نیرنگ کنید"}}]}, {"ref": "86:15", "tense": "present", "category": {"tense": "present", "pronoun": "hum", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/5946.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "Lo! they plot a plot (against thee, O Muhammad)", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Haberin olsun ki, kâfirler hep hile kuruyorlar.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "بیشک کافر اپنا سا داؤ چلتے ہیں", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Sesungguhnya orang kafir itu merencanakan tipu daya yang jahat dengan sebenar-benarnya.", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "إِنَّهُمْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "يَكِيدُونَ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/093acc701a8dc6c2c3bb.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "smišljaju lukavstvo", "en": "they are plotting", "tr": "hile yapıyorlar", "fr": "ils complotent", "id": "mereka merencanakan tipu daya", "ur": "وہ چال چل رہے ہیں", "bn": "তারা চক্রান্ত করছে", "fa": "نیرنگ می‌زنند"}}, {"text": "كَيْدًا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "21:57", "tense": "present", "category": {"tense": "present", "pronoun": "ana", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/2540.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "And, by Allah, I shall circumvent your idols after ye have gone away and turned your backs.", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "\"Allah'a yemin ederim ki, siz arkanızı dönüp gittikten sonra, ben putlarınıza elbette bir tuzak kuracağım.\"", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "اور مجھے اللہ کی قسم ہے میں تمہارے بتوں کا برا چاہوں گا بعد اس کے کہ تم پھر جاؤ پیٹھ دے کر", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Demi Allah, sesungguhnya aku akan melakukan tipu daya terhadap berhala-berhalamu sesudah kamu pergi meninggalkannya.", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "وَتَٱللَّهِ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "لَأَكِيدَنَّ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/92da25f1f507369ad072.m4a", "gloss": {"en": "surely I will plot", "bs": "zaista ću spletkariti", "tr": "kesinlikle entrika çevireceğim", "fr": "je vais assurément comploter", "id": "sungguh aku akan bertipu daya", "ur": "یقیناً میں تدبیر کروں گا", "bn": "নিশ্চয়ই আমি ষড়যন্ত্র করব", "fa": "قطعاً توطئه خواهم کرد"}}, {"text": "أَصْنَٰمَكُم", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "بَعْدَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "أَن", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "تُوَلُّوا۟", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "مُدْبِرِينَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}], "forms": [{"arabic": "كِيدُونِ", "count": 1, "first": "7:195", "audio": "audio/f787d453ac8c99f5c6ee.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "antum", "passive": false, "objects": ["ana"]}], "gloss": {"en": "(you all) plot against me!", "bs": "spletkarite protiv mene!", "tr": "bana karşı entrika çevirin!", "fr": "complotez contre moi !", "id": "lakukanlah tipu daya terhadapku!", "ur": "مجھ سے مکر کرو!", "bn": "তোমরা আমার বিরুদ্ধে ষড়যন্ত্র কর!", "fa": "علیه من توطئه کنید!"}}, {"arabic": "فَكِيدُونِى", "count": 1, "first": "11:55", "audio": "audio/bb5643f6d7066943a51a.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "past", "pronoun": "hum", "passive": true, "objects": ["ana"]}]}, {"arabic": "فَيَكِيدُوا۟", "count": 1, "first": "12:5", "audio": "audio/6ef8cfbb8af42eedbddc.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "present", "pronoun": "hum", "passive": false, "objects": [], "mood": "subjunctive"}], "gloss": {"en": "so they plot", "bs": "pa spletkare", "tr": "böylece entrika çevirirler", "fr": "qu'ils complotent alors", "id": "maka mereka bertipu daya", "ur": "پس وہ مکر کرتے ہیں", "bn": "অতএব তারা ষড়যন্ত